          ]
        },
        {
          "part": "f(iii)",
          "steps": [
            {
              "code": "A1",
              "text": "$E(Z)=0$."
            },
            {
              "code": "A1",
              "text": "$\\operatorname{Var}(Z)=1$."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "answerSummary": "$P(R<480)=0.13326026\\ldots\\approx0.133$. $(0.5-0.13326026\\ldots)/(1-0.13326026\\ldots)\\approx0.423$. $c=518.6558\\ldots\\approx519$grams. $B\\sim\\operatorname{Bin}(5,0.13326026\\ldots)$. $P(B=1)=5p(1-p)^4\\approx0.376$. $\\mu_C=(724+776)/2=750$grams. $\\sigma=38.5477\\ldots\\approx38.5$grams. $E(X^2)=25+400^2=160025$. $E(Y)=1202$. $\\operatorname{Var}(Y)=9\\operatorname{Var}(X)=225$. $E(Z)=0$. $\\operatorname{Var}(Z)=1$.",
      "sourcePages": [
